  "prefLabel": "Box 702.01 Amateur Mixed Martial Arts",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Box 702.01 Amateur Mixed Martial Arts. All amateur mixed martial arts competitions shall be conducted in compliance with Box 701 with the following modifications:\n\n(a) Fighters may wear shin pads and instep pads made for competition in combat sports in matches where both fighters agree to wear shin pads and instep pads;\n\n(b) Elbow strikes shall be prohibited;\n\n(c) Knee strikes to an opponent’s head shall be prohibited; and\n\n(d) All fights shall be 3 rounds of 3 minutes each, with a one minute rest period in between rounds.\n\nSource. #10483, eff 12-5-13; ss by #14066 eff 8-27-24; ss by #14226, eff 4-1-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/box100-800.html"
